theorem `span_singleton_generator` / 定理 `span_singleton_generator`

English:
theorem span_singleton_generator
  given: (S : Submodule R M) [S.IsPrincipal]
  statement: span R {generator S} = S
  proof: (Classical.choose_spec (principal S)).symm

